      "value": "Before the last update it was having the forced neck straightening issue when head lock mode was selected, but it was fine with hip lock mode.\nAfter the update now both modes result neck being force straightened in vertical position.\nThe armature on the avatars tested is the same as the pictures provided above.\nOn my pictures: \n1 is avatar in T-pose with no applied calibration.\n2 the same avatar with applied calibration.\n3 another avatar in T-pose without applied calibration.\n4 the second avatar with applied calibration.\nps: build 11748",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
